Package: MaMaMIA
Title: Max Mapping for Meticulous Introgression Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Aleksey", "Ermolaev", , "alerm@al-erm.ru", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The MaMaMIA provides a workflow for rapid Genotyping-by-Sequencing (GBS) analysis, enabling automated introgression detection. It integrates GC‑bias correction, pairwise chromosome comparison, and coverage depth profile segmentation to identify introgressed segments.
